  - m_Id: 1236262951
    m_Localized: close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262952
    m_Localized: 'Click one of the options above

      to select it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262953
    m_Localized: 'Click your character and drag

      with the mouse to aim and
      set

      the power.

      you get to use this once per

      turn before
      you use a weapon.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262954
    m_Localized: 'click here if you want to finish

      your turn without using
      a

      weapon.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262955
    m_Localized: 'click here to cancel and select

      another player.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262956
    m_Localized: Computer, take your turn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262957
    m_Localized: Player {0}, take your turn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262958
    m_Localized: collected {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262959
    m_Localized: loading
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262960
    m_Localized: cherry bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262961
    m_Localized: 'Basic weak weapon which

      explodes on impact.

      Click
      the cherry bomb and drag

      with your mouse to aim and set

      the power.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262962
    m_Localized: dynamite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262963
    m_Localized: 'This weapon explodes when it

      comes to rest.

      Click
      the dynamite and drag

      with your mouse to aim and set

      the power.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262964
    m_Localized: boulder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262965
    m_Localized: 'Large boulder which can bash

      other players out of the way.

      Click
      the boulder and drag

      with your mouse to aim and set

      the power.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262966
    m_Localized: pieces of eight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262967
    m_Localized: 'Eight coins which inflict a small

      amount of damage. You
      get

      eight turns with this weapon.

      Click each one and drag to
      aim

      and set the power.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262968
    m_Localized: rum bottle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262969
    m_Localized: 'This weapon explodes on impact

      and sets the nearby area
      on fire.

      Click it and drag

      with your mouse to aim and set

      the
      power.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262970
    m_Localized: banana
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262971
    m_Localized: 'This weapon is very bouncy.

      Click and drag with the mouse

      to
      aim and set the power.

      Then click your mouse again to

      make it
      explode.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262972
    m_Localized: parachute bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262973
    m_Localized: 'Click and drag with the mouse

      to aim and set the power.

      As
      it drifts down use

      your cursor as a fan to push it

      left or right.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262974
    m_Localized: crates
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262975
    m_Localized: 'Click anywhere on the stage to

      place down three crates.

      use
      these to form a wall to

      protect your characters.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262976
    m_Localized: gunpowder barrels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262977
    m_Localized: 'Click anywhere on the stage to

      place down two barrels.

      these
      will explode when hit by

      a weapon.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262978
    m_Localized: seagull
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262979
    m_Localized: 'Click on the screen to choose a

      path for the seagull to
      fly.

      Then click repeatedly to poop

      on the enemy!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262980
    m_Localized: mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262981
    m_Localized: 'Click the mine and drag

      with the mouse to aim and

      set
      the power.

      It will detonate when

      another player moves nearby.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262982
    m_Localized: cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262983
    m_Localized: 'Drag the cannon into position

      within the circle.

      click
      and drag the pin at the

      back to turn the cannon.

      release it to
      fire!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262984
    m_Localized: anchor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262985
    m_Localized: 'Click anywhere in the stage to

      drop a huge anchor down

      onto
      enemies!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262986
    m_Localized: voodoo doll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262987
    m_Localized: 'choose an enemy player by

      clicking on them. then click

      and
      drag to throw the doll and

      watch the enemy helplessly

      fly off
      in the same direction!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262988
    m_Localized: tidal wave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262989
    m_Localized: 'click to send a huge tidal wave

      across the bottom of the
      stage.

      It will affect all players it

      hits.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226425741312
    m_Localized: Arrrgh what sort o' sea|beastie be this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684352
    m_Localized: Splund splund... I'm gonna|ink you up... splund splund.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684353
    m_Localized: Yearggh take that you|varmint, we be eating squid|rings tonight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684354
    m_Localized: Splund splund... I'm so|happy I've just inked|myself... splund.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684355
    m_Localized: Looks like we've got a|bad case of the crabs|here, mateys!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684356
    m_Localized: Prepare to lose your|beards... snip snip!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684357
    m_Localized: I think we shell-shocked|them, mateys!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684358
    m_Localized: Looks like they fell for|our deadly pincer|manoeuvre... at last
      their|beards be ours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684359
    m_Localized: Ahoy. I think there be|something fishy here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684360
    m_Localized: We're gonna hammer you!|You're Shark Bait!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684361
    m_Localized: Ya Har! 'Twas too easy!|But thar be plenty more|fish in the sea!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684362
    m_Localized: Stop! ...Hammer-time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684363
    m_Localized: Arrrgh!... Who be a pretty|boy then? ...Does Polly|want a cracker?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684364
    m_Localized: Squawk!... Who's a pretty|boy then? ...Squawk!...|Polly want a cracker!|...Squawk!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684365
    m_Localized: Arrrgh... 'tiz a shame.|They could have made fine|shoulder enhancers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684366
    m_Localized: Squawk!... Polly want a|cracker!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684367
    m_Localized: Guard the fruit mateys...|If the monkeys get it we'll|be up for
      another bout|of scurvy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684368
    m_Localized: Oooh Oooh Ahh Ahh Bananas!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684369
    m_Localized: Yarrgh! Yer monkey business|ain't foolin' any of us!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684370
    m_Localized: Oooh Oooh Ahh Ahh More|Bananas!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684371
    m_Localized: These boys look too clean|to be in a real fight! And|look... they've
      still got|teeth to knock out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684372
    m_Localized: We fight for King and|Country! ...and because we|get a decent benefits|package
      and pension plan!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684373
    m_Localized: They don't look so smart|now lads... I think We'll|be using his
      toupee to swab|the decks!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684374
    m_Localized: You pirates will get what|you deserve... a short drop|and a sudden
      stop!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684375
    m_Localized: Yargh... These guys have|one too many eye patches!|This should be
      easy! Let's|get 'em!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684376
    m_Localized: Get who? Where am I...|how did I get here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684377
    m_Localized: Yarrgh!|They didn't see us coming!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684378
    m_Localized: Gar... I can't hear them...|Does anyone know if we|won?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684379
    m_Localized: Garrrgh... Looks like we've|found ourselves some|mighty fine booty
      here,|mateys!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684380
    m_Localized: Yarp... The only booty you|will be getting is on the|end of my foot!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684381
    m_Localized: Arrgh... shame... what a|waste of such lovely|sea legs!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684382
    m_Localized: Yarp... Everybody knows|girls are better than boys!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684383
    m_Localized: Arrrrggggh... I think we|found some old sea dogs!|Ready for retirement!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684384
    m_Localized: We're not Old, we're|experienced... and now we're|gonna kick your...
      erm...|erm... what was I saying|again... who are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684385
    m_Localized: Garrrrgh! Ok, Grandads...|time for your afternoon|nap!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684386
    m_Localized: That'll show you... in my|day we used to fight a|Kraken with nothin'
      but a|couple o' stones. Arrrgh...|Those be the days...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684387
    m_Localized: This guy be looking a little|too jolly to be flying the|ol' jolly
      roger, eh mateys?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684388
    m_Localized: Ohhhh look at you... don't|you look tough? Anyway,|haven't you heard?
      Fancy|colours are the new black!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684389
    m_Localized: I'd have beaten you sooner if|your fancy beards didn't|keep catchin'
      the light!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684390
    m_Localized: Oo-er! Now we're finished|with them, it's time for a|bit of retail
      therapy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684391
    m_Localized: Yarrgh! ...ye be wanting to|grow a proper beard before|taking on
      the likes of us,|boys...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684392
    m_Localized: We're no boys! I had a couple|of hairs only last month on|me chin,
      just ask me mum!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684393
    m_Localized: Yarrgh! Best be running|along home now boys! I think|it be past
      yer bedtime?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684394
    m_Localized: That was fun... just like a|Nitrome video game! LOL!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684395
    m_Localized: Garrgh! I've got a bad feelin'|about this lads! They be|lookin'
      kinda hungry!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684396
    m_Localized: Get the cookin' pot ready...|pirate stew tonight!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684397
    m_Localized: Good work lads! we've|avoided being lunch... looks|like they'll
      have to stick|with mangos and coconuts|from now on!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684398
    m_Localized: mmmmmmm! can't remember|the last time we had a good|pirate stew!|...has
      anyone got the salt?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684399
    m_Localized: This crew looks like they|could do with a good feed|more than a
      fight...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684400
    m_Localized: you'll have to catch us all|first ...fatty!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684401
    m_Localized: I am rubber, you are glue!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684402
    m_Localized: Sticks and stones may break|my bones but pirates never|hurt me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684403
    m_Localized: Garrrgh! what a big hat...|I think he be trying to|make up for something,
      lads!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684404
    m_Localized: Argh! ye not be winning with|a hat like that. And once I|win I'll
      be taking your hats.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684405
    m_Localized: I think he was a little|hot-headed...|maybe it was his hat!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684406
    m_Localized: These hats 'll be a mighty|fine addition to my|collection!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684407
    m_Localized: I think he's been playing|with a few too many|voodoo dolls, lads!
      he's back|from Davey Jones locker.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684408
    m_Localized: aaaaaaaaahhhhhhhh...|hhhhhaaaaattttttss...|errrr... I mean...|bbbbrrraaaiiinnsss...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684409
    m_Localized: Yo-Ho-Ho... we've done it|lads! that finished him off...|eerrrrm
      didn't we?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684410
    m_Localized: Yar hats be mine after all!|hhhhhaaaaattttttss!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684411
    m_Localized: Arrgh, Ahoy mateys! That|be too easy. Them bunch of|lilly livred
      land lubbers|never stood a chance.|we be both filthy and rich |now. Nothing
      be standing in |our way. Yo ho ho...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684412
    m_Localized: Aye... that be true. Unless|we be bumping into the|kraken that is?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684413
    m_Localized: kraken... what kraken?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684414
    m_Localized: Yearrrgh... I think he be on |about the sequel captin!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684415
    m_Localized: ...Sequel ...what sequel?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684416
    m_Localized: quit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684417
    m_Localized: music
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84226467684418
    m_Localized: sound fx
